msgid ""
"If you connect your scales through the IoT App, the\n"
"                            weight of the package will be set automatically "
"when\n"
"                            you do a \"Put in Pack\" operation.\n"
"                            <br/>"
msgstr ""
"IoTアプリでスケールを接続して、\n"
"                            '梱包する'処理を行うと\n"
"                            自動的に荷物の重量が設定されます。\n"
"                            <br/>"

